## KratosOS persona isolation policy for Qubes OS (qrexec 4.1+ format).
##
## Installed to dom0 as /etc/qubes/policy.d/30-kratos.policy. It runs BEFORE the
## default 90-* policies, so these rules win (first match wins in qrexec). Every
## qube that holds the persona carries the tag 'kratos-persona' (set by the Salt
## formula).
##
## Model: ALLOWLIST. The persona may initiate ONLY the few flows listed under
## "allow"; every other qrexec call it makes — to any other qube AND to dom0 —
## is denied by the catch-all rules at the bottom. Note that @anyvm EXCLUDES
## dom0/@adminvm, which is why dom0 is denied explicitly on its own line.
##
## IMPORTANT: the catch-all denies are intentionally total. On a LIVE Qubes
## system you may find the persona legitimately needs a small number of benign
## VM->dom0 services (e.g. qubes.GetDate, qubes.NotifyUpdates). If so, ADD them
## as explicit `allow` lines ABOVE the catch-alls after verifying each one — do
## not relax the catch-alls. This file must be validated with Qubes' own policy
## tooling on a real dom0; a KratosOS lint is not authoritative.

## ---- Allow: the ONLY flows the persona needs ----
## Updates go through the Whonix updates proxy.
qubes.UpdatesProxy    *  @tag:kratos-persona  @default             allow target=sys-whonix

## ---- Explicit denies of the high-risk cross-qube services (both directions) ----
## Redundant with the catch-alls below, but they state the intent unambiguously
## and are what the KratosOS tests check for.
qubes.ClipboardPaste  *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny
qubes.ClipboardPaste  *  @anyvm               @tag:kratos-persona  deny
qubes.Filecopy        *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny
qubes.Filecopy        *  @anyvm               @tag:kratos-persona  deny
qubes.OpenInVM        *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny
qubes.OpenInVM        *  @anyvm               @tag:kratos-persona  deny
qubes.OpenURL         *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny
qubes.OpenURL         *  @anyvm               @tag:kratos-persona  deny
qubes.VMShell         *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny
qubes.VMRootShell     *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny

## ---- Catch-all: nothing else leaves the persona, to dom0 or to any qube ----
## (Networking is unaffected — it flows through the netvm, not qrexec.)
*                     *  @tag:kratos-persona  @adminvm            deny
*                     *  @tag:kratos-persona  @anyvm              deny
## And no one may call INTO the persona (dom0 management is NOT matched here,
## because @anyvm excludes dom0, so Qubes can still start/stop the persona).
*                     *  @anyvm               @tag:kratos-persona  deny
